13726.docs:
The `non_ascii_idents` lint detects non-ASCII identifiers.

### Example

```rust,compile_fail
# #![allow(unused)]
#![deny(non_ascii_idents)]
fn main() {
    let föö = 1;
}
```

{{produces}}

### Explanation

This lint allows projects that wish to retain the limit of only using
